附件2：景福花园项目选房交通指引和注意事项.pdf','[{"id": 1736555, "name": "附件1：本批次住房认购申请家庭选房时间安排表(049号).pdf", "type": "pdf", "mime": "application/pdf", "size": "60598", "url": "https://www.szlh.gov.cn/lhqzfhjsj/attachment/1/1736/1736555/12614143.pdf"}, {"id": 1736556, "name": "附件2：景福花园项目选房交通指引和注意事项.pdf", "type": "pdf", "mime": "application/pdf", "size": "202243", "url": "https://www.szlh.gov.cn/lhqzfhjsj/attachment/1/1736/1736556/12614143.pdf"}]','2026-11-07 03:26:42');
